# NPC skaters and a van in the park (game/vehicles.ts reactNpcs, docs/mechanics/driving.md; data/vehicles.json
# reactions). One NPC skater rides east along the north side and turns south down the east side; a van
# comes west along the north side at 4 m/s to meet it. Coming at it, the skater shouts (npcShout, a line
# from reactions.npcShouts); reached, it jumps clear to its side of the van (npcDodge) and, trying for its
# line, keeps to the van's side until it has gone by. The van never drives through it, and nothing bails.
park soma
cmd 1 npc spawn 1
cmd 1 vehicle spawn van 36 19.3 270
cmd 2 vehicle enter van
bot drive 36,19.3 20,19.3 from 200 speed 4 stop
run 900
expect event npcShout within 328..338
expect event npcShout count == 1
expect event npcDodge within 411..421
expect min npc.gap > 1.3
expect no event npcBail
expect no event vanBump
